config BCM4773
	tristate "Broadcom BCM4773 GNSS and sensor hub bridge"
	depends on SPI && OF
	depends on GPIOLIB
	help
	  Bridge driver for the Broadcom BCM4773 GNSS chip, which also carries
	  the sensor hub of the Samsung Galaxy S6. The chip is reached over
	  Broadcom's SSI protocol on SPI. Broadcom's lhd daemon loads the
	  chip's RAM firmware and drives GNSS through /dev/bbd_*; the sensor
	  hub driver talks to the hub through this bridge.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called bcm4773.
